# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
# Allowlist: only the locked environment definition, the package and the migrations
# enter the build context. Private files, local data and caches never can.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!alembic.ini
!migrations/
# The licence texts each package's metadata names, so the installed dist-info carries them.
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!clients/python/pyproject.toml
!clients/python/README.md
!clients/python/LICENSE
!clients/python/src/
!integrations/mde-producer/pyproject.toml
!integrations/mde-producer/README.md
!integrations/mde-producer/LICENSE
!integrations/mde-producer/src/
!protocol/pyproject.toml
!protocol/README.md
!protocol/LICENSE
!protocol/src/
!connectors/pyproject.toml
!connectors/README.md
!connectors/LICENSE
!connectors/src/
# The console's sources for the Node stage; its installed and built output never do.
!console/
# The two Tines stories and their licence, which the console build copies for Getting started.
!integrations/LICENSE
!integrations/tines/execbound-governed-action.json
!integrations/tines/execbound-gate.json
console/node_modules/
console/dist/
src/execbound/surfaces/console_dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
